chapter AFP

session Grounding_Classical_Base = Grounding_Base +
  description \<open>Thin layer loading the Formal-PDDL-Semantics classical PDDL semantics
    (Classical_Planning, which extends Temporal_Planning) on top of the stable Grounding_Base heap.
    Because the heavy continuous/ODE tower lives BELOW this layer, an edit to the temporal /
    classical PDDL semantics in Formal-PDDL-Semantics only re-elaborates these light theories,
    not the whole Continuous_Planning tower. SAT-free and graph-free. No project-local theories.\<close>
  sessions
    "Classical_Planning"
  theories [document = false]
    "Classical_Planning.Classical_Happening_Semantics"
    "Classical_Planning.Classical_PDDL_Checker_Numeric"
